{"id":"word:hebrew:H1537","type":"word","title":"גִּלְגָּל","subtitle":"H1537 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Gilgal , the name of three places in Palestine","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to גִּלְגָּל (H1537) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-loc.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 41 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"גִּלְגָּל (Gilgâl) means Gilgal , the name of three places in Palestine First listed occurrence: 1Sam 7 16."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"גִּלְגָּל","transliteration":"Gilgâl","pronunciation":"ghil-gawl'","strong":"H1537","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1537","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-loc","forms":["הַ/גִּלְגָּ֗ל","הַ/גִּלְגָּֽל","הַ/גִּלְגָּ֔ל","הַ/גִּלְגָּ֑ל","בַּ/גִּלְגָּ֔ל"],"morphs":[["HTd/Np",20],["HRd/Np",10],["HTd/Np/Sd",6],["HC/Td/Np",2],["HNp",2],["HR/Np",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"Gilgal , the name of three places in Palestine","usage":"Gilgal. See also 1019 .","full":"H1537. Gilgal II. גִּלְגָּל proper name, of a location (= (sacred) circle of stones; compare Di on Josh 5:9 , where word-play on roll away, off) — with article except 5:9 ; 12:23 ; &#8212; 1 place east of Jericho, where Israel lay encamped Josh 4:19-20 , 5:9-10 , 9:6 ; 10:7 , 9 ; 14:6 compare also Micah 6:5 & Judg 3:19 אֶתהַֿגּ ׳אֲשֶׁר הַמְּסִילִים ;? modern Tell Jeljul Bd Pal 169 ; perhaps also the place where sacrifices were offered 1Sam 10:8 ; 11:14-15 , (twice in verse); 13:4 , 7 , 8 , 12 , 15 (in 13:15 insert also with other words, Dr compare We) 15:12 , 21 , 33 ; place of illicit sacrifice Hosea 4:15 ; 9:15 ; 12:12 ; Amos 4:4 ; 5:5 (twice in verse), named also Judg 2:1 ; 1Sam 7:16 ; 2Sam 19:16 ; 19:41 ; ? = הַגִּלְגָּל בֵּית Neh 12:29 . 2 place on border between Judah & Benjamin Josh 15:17 (= גְּלִילוֺת 18:17 compare Di). 3 place in Northern Israel, dwelling of prophets 2Kin 2:1 ; 4:38 , modern Jiljilie south from Nâbulus, southwest from Seilûn (Shiloh) compare Di Ri HWB 518. 4 place in Northern Israel near Mt. Gerizim and Mt. Ebal Deut 11:30 , identification with 3 by Ke Ri HWB 518 Schenkel BL SS; but compare Di. 5 in phrase לְגִּלְגָּל גּוֺיִם מֶלֶךְ Josh 12:23 , in list of Canaanitish kings; probably name of a (northern) district compare Di (B βασιλέα Γεεὶ τῆς Γαλιλαίας — but ᵐ5 L & Manuscripts Γοειμ τῆς Γελγελ ); Di compare Isaiah 8:23.","rootNote":"the same as 1536 (with the article as a properly, noun);","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 7 16","keyReferences":["1Sam 7 16","1Sam 10 8","1Sam 11 14","1Sam 11 15","1Sam 11 15","1Sam 13 4","1Sam 13 7","1Sam 13 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":41,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 7 16","book":"1Sam","chapter":7,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הַ/גִּלְגָּ֖ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Td/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 10 8","book":"1Sam","chapter":10,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/גִּלְגָּל֒","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 11 14","book":"1Sam","chapter":11,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/גִּלְגָּ֑ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 11 15","book":"1Sam","chapter":11,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/גִּלְגָּ֗ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 11 15","book":"1Sam","chapter":11,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/גִּלְגָּ֔ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 13 4","book":"1Sam","chapter":13,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/גִּלְגָּֽל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 13 7","book":"1Sam","chapter":13,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַ/גִּלְגָּ֔ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 13 8","book":"1Sam","chapter":13,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/גִּלְגָּ֑ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 13 12","book":"1Sam","chap